ull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116406","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116406","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116406.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116406.patch","merged_at":"2026-02-18T14:35:30Z"},"body":"- Helps address #111218. `display_server.h` is one of the biggest contributor to slow build times, so reducing its direct dependencies should help a bit. The real gains will come from reducing its reverse dependencies, i.e. files which include `display_server.h` (oftentimes only for `DisplayServer::WindowID` which is a prime candidate for moving to a separate `display_server_enums.h` file).\r\n\r\nChanges:\r\n\r\n- Removes `native_menu.h` dependency from `display_server.h`. It's now forward-declared in all DisplayServer implementations and should be included in the .cpp's.\r\n  * I did it for X11/Wayland, together with a thorough cleanup to move as much as possible to the .cpp. Will have to check the other platforms before this is mergeable.\r\n  * *Edit:* Done for other platforms with minimal changes.\r\n- Removes some unused `rb_set.h` and `rb_map.h` dependencies, which leads to having to include them explicitly in half the scene and editor codebase... which shows how much we depend on `display_server.h`.\r\n- Replaces `input_event.h` with a forward-declare, so now we need only `keyboard.h`.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://a